('Workspace Alpha has 12 jobs: 7 succeeded, 3 failed and 2 remain queued. These are mutually exclusive statuses and cover every job in Alpha.', 'Exactly five jobs in Alpha have not succeeded.', 'supports', 'Three failed plus two queued.'),
('A token is accepted when its expiry is later than now and its scope includes read. Token X includes read but expired yesterday; now is today.', 'Token X is accepted under the stated rule.', 'contradicts', 'The expiry condition explicitly fails.'),
