('Tenant A reports no failed transactions in its 20-record sample. The record provides no information about Tenant B.', 'Tenant B had no failed transactions.', 'insufficient', 'The assertion extends beyond the observed tenant.'),
('The incident report explicitly states that no customer data was lost; two monitoring samples were lost. Customer data and monitoring samples are separate categories here.', 'The report says customer data was not lost.', 'supports', 'The source expressly distinguishes the categories.'),
('The experiment compared 30 tasks. The old system got 27 correct, and the new system got 26 correct. Each task has a single scored result.', 'The new system had strictly more correct tasks than the old system.', 'contradicts', '26 is fewer than 27.'),
('The endpoint accepts a string named region. Its documentation does not enumerate valid region values or describe validation behavior.', 'Passing region mars returns an HTTP 400 response.', 'insufficient', 'Neither accepted values nor response behavior are supplied.'),
('Requests use the environment token if it is nonempty; otherwise the file token is used. The environment token is empty and the file token is present.', 'The file token is selected by this precedence rule.', 'supports', 'The empty environment value activates the fallback.'),
('The migration changes only the display alias. The immutable account ID and all stored event IDs remain unchanged.', 'This migration changes stored event IDs.', 'contradicts', 'The source expressly says those IDs remain unchanged.'),
('A release candidate passed every test that was run. The record does not specify which tests were run.', 'The release candidate passed the security test suite.', 'insufficient', 'The unspecified set need not contain security tests.'),
('The scheduler starts an export after both checksum verification and schema validation pass. Both checks passed for job K and the scheduler started its export.', 'The export for job K has started.', 'supports', 'The final clause explicitly records the action, not just eligibility.'),
('The reported cost was 80 units before the change and 100 units after it. These totals cover the same workload and accounting boundary.', 'The change reduced the total reported cost.', 'contradicts', 'The measured total increased from 80 to 100.'),
('Two equally authoritative probes report opposite states for the same host at the same instant. Probe A reports healthy; probe B reports unhealthy. Neither is designated as authoritative over the other.', 'The host was healthy at that instant.', 'insufficient', 'The supplied unresolved conflict prevents establishing either state.'),
('The configuration sets maxRetries to zero. In this system maxRetries counts additional attempts after the initial request. The initial request is still sent.', 'This configuration sends an initial request and performs no automatic retry.', 'supports', 'Zero additional attempts does not suppress the initial attempt.'),
('Retention lasts 30 days except for legal-hold records, which are retained until the hold is released. Record R has an active legal hold and was created 40 days ago.', 'The stated retention rule requires deleting R now solely because it is older than 30 days.', 'contradicts', 'The active legal hold is an explicit exception.'),
('A maintainer opened a pull request that proposes enabling feature Q. The text gives no merge result or production deployment status.', 'Feature Q is enabled in production.', 'insufficient', 'A proposal is not a deployed state.'),
('The benchmark has 18 successful requests and 2 timed-out requests. All 20 attempted requests are included in its denominator.', 'Its success fraction is 90 percent.', 'supports', '18 divided by 20 is 90 percent.'),
('The authorization rule is deny if any required check fails. Check A passed, check B failed, and check C passed.', 'The stated rule authorizes this request.', 'contradicts', 'One failed required check is sufficient for denial.'),
('The changelog states that crash frequency fell after the cache patch. It does not isolate the cache patch from other simultaneous changes.', 'The cache patch alone caused the fall in crash frequency.', 'insufficient', 'The causal attribution is not established.'),
