('All four required checks passed for package Z. The release policy permits publication when all required checks pass. Permission to publish and actual publication are separate events.', 'Package Z satisfies the stated checks needed for permission to publish.', 'supports', 'The claim concerns eligibility only.'),
('The batch receipt reports 10 decisions, including 3 flagged for manual review. A flagged decision remains unresolved until reviewed.', 'All 10 decisions in this receipt are already resolved.', 'contradicts', 'Three explicitly remain unresolved.'),
('The new parser matched the old parser on a fixed set of 50 inputs. Inputs outside that set were not tested.', 'The parsers return identical results for every possible input.', 'insufficient', 'Agreement on a finite tested set does not establish universality.'),
('原始記錄：A 區已完成部署；B 區仍在排程中。此處「全部部署完成」要求 A、B 兩區都完成。', '目前還不符合「全部部署完成」的定義。', 'supports', 'B 區尚未完成，因此未達明定條件。'),
('修訂紀錄：09:00 設定保留 7 天；10:00 核准修訂為 14 天，並明示取代 09:00 的設定。這份記錄沒有後續修訂。', '依這份記錄，目前核准的保留時間仍為 7 天。', 'contradicts', '後續核准修訂明確取代舊設定。'),
('測試紀錄只有模擬器上的登入成功，沒有實機登入紀錄。', '使用者的實體手機目前可以成功登入。', 'insufficient', '模擬器成功無法證明實機目前狀態。'),
('For task T, the deadline is 17:00 UTC. Completion at or before the deadline is on time. T completed at 16:59 UTC on the same date.', 'Task T completed on time.', 'supports', 'The recorded completion precedes the explicit deadline.'),
